---
# Google style, unchanged — the naming rules in AGENTS.md follow it too.
#
# This file was a full `--dump-config` and carried not one deviation from the
# base style. That is not merely long, it breaks: a dump names every option of
# the version that wrote it, so an older clang-format aborts on the first key it
# does not know ("unknown key") and formats by the LLVM default instead. The
# CI container (Ubuntu 26.04, clang-format 21) fell over exactly that way.
#
# Whoever adds a deviation writes that one line here — never a dump.
Language: Cpp
BasedOnStyle: Google
...
